  "description": "Redis-backed resumable upload session store for Vali-Blob — the unified cloud storage abstraction library for .NET.\n        Implements IResumableUploadStore over StackExchange.Redis, enabling durable, distributed tracking\n        of multipart / chunked upload sessions across Vali-Blob providers (AWS, Azure, GCP, OCI, Supabase).\n        Supports TTL-based session expiration and horizontal scaling.\n        Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net6.0, net7.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
